# Tailwind

## Rules

- Use **Tailwind utility classes** exclusively.
- No second UI component library (no MUI, shadcn, Chakra, etc.).
- No custom design token layer (no `tokens.css`, no Verdant).
- The only CSS file is `src/index.css` which contains only the three `@tailwind` directives.
- Use `src/lib/cn.ts` to conditionally join class strings.

## Stock theme

The Tailwind theme is stock default (`tailwind.config.js` `theme.extend` is empty).
If you need a custom colour or spacing, use an arbitrary value (e.g. `bg-[#1a2b3c]`)
or extend the theme — do not introduce a separate token system.

## Component style

- Prefer readable inline classes over extracted component abstractions.
- Extract a helper only when the same combination repeats 3+ times across files.
